{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object detected, move, take it, check properties, do specific task, otherwise scan. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToTheObject    /> <Action ID = TakeTheObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    />\"",
    "BT": {
